# ======================= V2.0.14 HOTFIX: NO LOADING RATE FIELD + STRICT PLAN MW/DENSITY SYNC =======================
# User-required behavior:
# 1) Remove the resin loading mmol/g input row from the Loading rate tab. Keep only the apply checkbox,
#    Loading amino acid eq, Loading DIEA eq, and loading solvent.
# 2) 2-CTC and CTC(합성용) are different:
#    - 2-CTC = direct-loading resin; loading row appears only when the checkbox is ON.
#    - CTC(합성용) = preloaded/synthesizer resin; treat like Amide; loading row must never appear.
# 3) Selected Plan must pre-fill MW and Density(g/mL) from Unit name for protected amino acids,
#    solids and liquids/reagents. Apply Plan must be single and must sync edits to Selected Plan,
#    Selected Materials and Batch Manager.
