    "Fmoc-Leu-OH","Fmoc-Lys(Boc)-OH","Fmoc-Met-OH","Fmoc-Phe-OH","Fmoc-Pro-OH","Fmoc-Ser(tBu)-OH",
    "Fmoc-Thr(tBu)-OH","Fmoc-Trp(Boc)-OH","Fmoc-Tyr(tBu)-OH","Fmoc-Val-OH",
