# ======================= V2.0.44 COMPLETE SETUP LINK + CHECKBOX + INLINE DROPDOWN PATCH =======================
# Based directly on V2.0.43, the latest user-tested version.
# Fixes:
# 1) Setup defaults fully drive plan generation: reagent/catalyst/base/count/solvent all update.
# 2) HOBt generic removed from user-facing choices; only HOBt Anhydrous and HOBt hydrate remain.
# 3) Default/Range mode has actual checkboxes and is mutually exclusive.
# 4) Selected Plan supports in-place double-click dropdown editing for Unit/Reagent/Catalyst/Base/Solvent.
# 5) Apply Plan is the single update route and refreshes Materials/Total from the visible Selected Plan.
# 6) Horizontal scrollbar is made visible/usable at bottom of selected plan even in smaller windows.
# 7) Numeric display keeps user input style: no forced integer-like rounding to tens; floats are preserved cleanly.
# =============================================================================================================

