# ======================= V2.0.48 HARD STABILIZATION PATCH =======================
# Based directly on V2.0.47.
# Purpose:
# - Remove runtime recursion risk from lookup aliases.
# - Remove runtime recursion risk from plan_detailed aliases.
# - Keep Custom DB, 1-use working volume, concentration mode, dropdown editor, Apply Plan.
# - Reduce duplicate Apply Plan/Edit buttons by hiding extras after build.
# ===============================================================================

