# ======================= V2.0.49 EXPANDED UNITS + MANUAL EDIT APPLY + DELETE ROW PATCH =======================
# Based directly on V2.0.48 stable branch.
# Adds:
# 1) Expanded selectable categories: natural AA, D-AA, non-natural AA, N-term chemicals, linkers, labels, tags.
# 2) Selected Plan double-click supports dropdown/text editing for Unit/Reagent/Catalyst/Base/Solvent and numeric fields
#    including MW, Density, Unit mmol, Reagent mmol, Base mmol, Solvent mL.
# 3) Apply Plan respects visible/manual-edited MW, density, mmol, amount, and solvent mL and rebuilds Materials/Total from visible rows.
