# ======================= V2.0.0 AUDIT REPAIR: LOADING CHECKBOX + 2-CTC STD RECONNECT =======================
# This final audit layer does not change the visible layout. It reconnects the
# existing Loading checkbox to the 2-CTC direct-loading calculation path and
# prevents the previous reference override from running when the checkbox is off.
# Rules enforced here:
#   - 2-CTC/Trityl direct loading is applied ONLY when the Loading checkbox is checked.
#   - When checked, the first C-terminal residue is treated as the resin-loading residue.
#   - For the uploaded GHK STD, the protected-AA profile is K=1.0 eq, H=1.5 eq, G=2.0 eq.
#   - MeOH capping is 2-CTC only and follows loading + DMF wash x2.
#   - Existing Add/Duplicate/Generate/Apply/Export UI wiring remains intact.
